{"seq":1,"slug":"jurisdiction-rule-scope","title":"司法辖区规则与作用域","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/compliance-policy-model/jurisdiction-rule-scope","wordCount":3613,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"司法辖区规则与作用域\">司法辖区规则与作用域</h1><p>同一个查询词，在柏林是合法的商品描述，在雅加达是不允许出现的宣称，在利雅得要整条类目下架——而这三个城市的用户可能正在访问同一个 CDN 边缘节点。合规过滤的第一个难题不是「怎么拦」，而是「用谁的规则拦、拦住谁看得见的那一份」。含糊过去，后面每一层闸门都建在流沙上：会出现德国看不到、印尼看得到的漏放，也会出现本该只在德国受限的商品在全球被误杀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-合规作用域是一个四元组\">核心概念：合规作用域是一个四元组</h2><p>「这条规则管不管这次请求」不是布尔判断，而是四个维度同时成立才算命中：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>apply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>jurisdiction</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊳</mo><mtext>market</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>channel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∋</mo><mtext>channel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>audience</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∋</mo><mtext>userProp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>time</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∋</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{apply}(r, q) = \\text{jurisdiction}(r) \\rhd \\text{market}(q) \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{channel}(r) \\ni \\text{channel}(q) \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{audience}(r) \\ni \\text{userProp}(q) \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{time}(r) \\ni t_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jurisdiction</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin amsrm\">⊳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">market</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">channel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">channel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">audience</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">userProp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">time</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>辖区决定规则由哪个法域的义务产生，市场是销售/服务市场，渠道区分站内搜索、广告位、开放 API 与内容分发，受众区分成人、未成年与企业采购，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表达生效/废止时间窗。这条公式把「规则适用性」从散落在代码里的 <code>if (country === &#39;DE&#39;)</code> 变成<strong>可被数据库约束、被版本化、被测试枚举的谓词</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[搜索请求 q] --&gt; R[解析请求属性]&#10;  R --&gt; M[作用域匹配器]&#10;  M --&gt; P[按 jurisdiction 选出候选规则集]&#10;  P --&gt; T{规则时间窗有效?}&#10;  T --&gt;|是| HIT[命中: 进入过滤判定]&#10;  T --&gt;|否| SKIP[跳过]&#10;  HIT --&gt; N[合并为生效策略快照]\">graph TD\n  Q[搜索请求 q] --&gt; R[解析请求属性]\n  R --&gt; M[作用域匹配器]\n  M --&gt; P[按 jurisdiction 选出候选规则集]\n  P --&gt; T{规则时间窗有效?}\n  T --&gt;|是| HIT[命中: 进入过滤判定]\n  T --&gt;|否| SKIP[跳过]\n  HIT --&gt; N[合并为生效策略快照]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>典型取值</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>jurisdiction</td>\n<td><code>EU</code>、<code>US-CA</code>、<code>DE</code>、<code>ID</code>、<code>SA</code>、<code>BR</code>、<code>CN</code></td>\n<td>法定义务归属，人工维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>market</td>\n<td><code>de-DE</code>、<code>id-ID</code>、<code>en-US</code>、<code>ar-SA</code></td>\n<td>请求的地理/站点上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>channel</td>\n<td><code>web</code>、<code>app</code>、<code>ads</code>、<code>openapi</code>、<code>feed</code></td>\n<td>请求入口标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>audience</td>\n<td><code>adult</code>、<code>minor</code>、<code>b2b</code></td>\n<td>账号年龄档、采购账号类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>time window</td>\n<td><code>[effective_from, effective_to)</code></td>\n<td>策略版本元数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么不能用-服务器位置-代替-jurisdiction\">为什么不能用「服务器位置」代替 jurisdiction</h3><p>「服务部署在法兰克福建，就按欧盟规则过滤」这个直觉在两种情况下直接造成事故：请求可能在法兰克福被处理，但用户、商品与交易都在印尼；同一内容在站内搜索与批发给第三方的开放 API，法律约束强度可能不同。它流行的原因，是把三个独立概念混成了一个：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>是否可作为 jurisdiction 依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据驻留地</td>\n<td>数据存在哪里</td>\n<td>否（只决定数据可存哪）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求处理节点</td>\n<td>计算在哪里发生</td>\n<td>否（同一节点服务多国用户）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>义务归属辖域</td>\n<td>谁的法定义务在约束这次</td>\n<td>是（唯一正确依据）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>所以 jurisdiction 必须是<strong>策略的显式属性</strong>：先推出需要满足哪些辖区，再取这些辖区规则的并集，这天然产生「同一内容在多辖区下取最严」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"作用域爆炸与它的治理\">作用域爆炸与它的治理</h3><p>辖区 × 市场 × 渠道 × 受众 × 时间窗，笛卡尔积很容易膨胀到六位数。三条抑制手段缺一不可，失效症状各不相同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>默认窄作用域</strong>：新规则没写 jurisdiction 时默认不生效，策略默认态必须是最小作用域；失效症状是规则数正常但影响面异常大。</li>\n<li><strong>继承与覆盖</strong>：规则带 <code>parent_rule_id</code> 与 <code>override_kind</code>，覆盖关系必须发布前静态校验，悬挂引用在 CI 阶段失败；失效症状是同一义务出现互相矛盾的两条。</li>\n<li><strong>等价类合并</strong>：27 个成员国中 24 个采用同一阈值时，应有一条「EU 基线条目 + 3 条例外覆盖」；判据是<strong>法定义务文本是否一致</strong>而不是运维方便，失效症状是规则库条目数与辖区数同步增长。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"辖区规则的建模-从法条到可执行对象\">辖区规则的建模：从法条到可执行对象</h2><p>法条不告诉你「字段叫什么」，只告诉你义务；把义务翻译成可执行对象需要一个中间层，它决定策略引擎能否被非工程师（法务、合规运营）维护：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;ID-RESTRICTED-CATEGORY-0142&quot;,&#10;  &quot;jurisdiction&quot;: &quot;ID&quot;,&#10;  &quot;parent_rule_id&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;override_kind&quot;: &quot;NONE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;legal_basis&quot;: { &quot;instrument&quot;: &quot;ID-MOC-2020-No.5&quot;, &quot;obligation&quot;: &quot;restricted_goods_display&quot; },&#10;  &quot;predicate&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;all_of&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;product.category_path&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;prefix_any&quot;, &quot;values&quot;: [&quot;Health/Supplements/*&quot;] },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;any_of&quot;: [&#10;          { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;content.text.normalized&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;regex&quot;, &quot;values&quot;: [&quot;(治疗|根治|替代药物)&quot;] },&#10;          { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;content.image.labels&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;in&quot;, &quot;values&quot;: [&quot;medication_packaging&quot;], &quot;threshold&quot;: 0.72 }&#10;        ]&#10;      },&#10;      { &quot;none_of&quot;: [{ &quot;field&quot;: &quot;seller.licenses&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;in&quot;, &quot;values&quot;: [&quot;health_supplement_registered&quot;] }] }&#10;    ]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;action&quot;: { &quot;on_hit&quot;: &quot;suppress&quot;, &quot;fallback_action&quot;: &quot;downrank_strong&quot;, &quot;user_visible_reason&quot;: &quot;LOCAL_REGULATION&quot; },&#10;  &quot;priority&quot;: 200,&#10;  &quot;effective_from&quot;: &quot;2026-03-01T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID-RESTRICTED-CATEGORY-0142\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"jurisdiction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"parent_rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"override_kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NONE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"legal_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"instrument\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID-MOC-2020-No.5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"obligation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"restricted_goods_display\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"predicate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"all_of\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"product.category_path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prefix_any\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"values\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Health/Supplements/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \