olor:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.72</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"none_of\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seller.licenses\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"values\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"health_supplement_registered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"on_hit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suppress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fallback_action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"downrank_strong\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"user_visible_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LOCAL_REGULATION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-03-01T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>legal_basis</code> 不是注释而是<strong>证据链的锚点</strong>：每份下架决定与监管报送都必须能回指到某个 <code>instrument</code> 与 <code>obligation</code>，否则无法回答「你凭什么下架这个」。<code>action.fallback_action</code> 是主判定不可用时的降级动作，必须比主动作<strong>更保守或等强度</strong>，绝不降级到放行。<code>user_visible_reason</code> 是给终端用户的合规理由码，展开见 <a href=\"../takedown-distribution/legal-correction-notice\">法定更正与辟谣内容</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"谓词边界与继承语义\">谓词边界与继承语义</h3><p>谓词太弱则每种新义务都要发版写代码，太强（允许内嵌脚本）则规则变成不可审计的代码；合适边界是<strong>声明式谓词的有限组合</strong>——字段取自商品结构化属性、内容文本与多模态特征、卖家合规画像，运算符限定为 <code>prefix_any</code>、<code>in</code>、<code>regex</code>、<code>threshold_gte</code>，组合限定为 <code>all_of</code> / <code>any_of</code> / <code>none_of</code> 树形嵌套。判据是<strong>树形谓词既能翻译成过滤表达式，也能翻译成人类可读解释</strong>。<code>parent_rule_id</code> 与 <code>override_kind</code> 则把继承从约定变成数据，三种关系的语义差别很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>override_kind</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>子规则字段如何取值</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>NONE</code></td>\n<td>独立规则，与父规则并存</td>\n<td>全部自填</td>\n<td>成员国独有义务，无上位基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NARROW</code></td>\n<td>在父规则基础上收窄作用域或加严</td>\n<td>动作不得弱于父规则，其余可覆</td>\n<td>某成员国把阈值调得更紧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>REPLACE</code></td>\n<td>完全替换父规则在本辖区的适用</td>\n<td>全部自填，父规则在本辖区失效</td>\n<td>成员国立法与该义务存在实质冲突</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>NARROW</code> 最容易写错：允许改动作，但只允许<strong>往更严的方向</strong>改。<code>REPLACE</code> 必须引用与父规则<strong>不同的文书</strong>，同文书而声称替换说明它其实是 <code>NARROW</code>。两条都要写成编译器断言，因为运行时的覆盖失效是静默的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"辖区规则的存储与继承\">辖区规则的存储与继承</h2><p>规则分两层存储：<strong>辖区层</strong>保存义务来源与时间窗，<strong>作用域层</strong>保存义务落在哪些市场、渠道、受众。分开的理由是一个义务常对应多个作用域分片，而法律依据与时间窗是同一份。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE jurisdiction_rules (&#10;  rule_id        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  jurisdiction   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  parent_rule_id TEXT REFERENCES jurisdiction_rules(rule_id),&#10;  override_kind  TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;NONE&#39;&#10;                 CHECK (override_kind IN (&#39;NONE&#39;,&#39;NARROW&#39;,&#39;REPLACE&#39;)),&#10;  legal_basis    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  obligation     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  action         TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  priority       INT  NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  tz_scope       TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;UTC&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE rule_scope_bindings (&#10;  rule_id   TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES jurisdiction_rules(rule_id),&#10;  scope_key TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (rule_id, scope_key)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jurisdiction_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  jurisdiction   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parent_rule_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jurisdiction_rules(rule_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  override_kind  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NONE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (override_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NONE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NARROW'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REPLACE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_basis    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  obligation     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  priority       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tz_scope       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UTC'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rule_scope_bindings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jurisdiction_rules(rule_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (rule_id, scope_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tz_scope</code> 必须显式存储：「当地时间某日生效」在不同时区对应的 UTC 时刻相差数小时，把换算结果物化（而不是运行时用服务器本地时间推断）才能让跨辖区生效时刻可核对；「相对某事件后 N 天」还要明确偏移按日历日还是 24 小时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地区判定-信号优先级与兜底\">地区判定：信号优先级与兜底</h2><p>作用域的输入是「这次请求属于哪个市场」，这个判断有多个信号源且可靠性差别很大；把它们加权平均是常见错误（一台机房出口 IP 会把一个印尼用户平均到全世界），正确做法是<strong>按优先级短路</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>取值来源</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>失效形态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>站点/域名</td>\n<td>请求 Host、路径前缀</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>几乎不失效，但只覆盖站内入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>收货地</td>\n<td>订单/购物车上下文</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无订单上下文时缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>账号注册地/偏好</td>\n<td>账号属性</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>迁移用户与代购账号会滞后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>显式市场参数</td>\n<td>API 调用方传入</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>开放 API 场景可能被伪造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>IP 地理定位</td>\n<td>边缘节点解析</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>VPN、企业出口、运营商级 NAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>语言/时区推断</td>\n<td>Accept-Language、客户端时区</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>常驻外国的用户误判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>次序的要害是<strong>第 1、2 级存在时不要看第 5 级</strong>：IP 定位只在没有更强信号时才有价值。实现上按序取最高优先级信号，取不到强信号才回落到 IP 并<strong>标记低置信</strong>，该标记必须传递到下游。兜底形态取决于<strong>漏放与误杀哪个更不可接受</strong>，而这两者在不同义务上并不一致：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兜底形态</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>漏放风险</th>\n<th>误杀风险</th>\n<th>适用义务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最严辖区并集</td>\n<td>对候选辖区集合取动作强度最大值</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>绝对禁止类义务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>站点默认辖区</td>\n<td>回落到站点自身的法定辖区</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>站内主导的常规场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球基线 + 标注</td>\n<td>用全球基线过滤并标注低置信</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>基线已足够严格的品类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空态</td>\n<td>不返回结果并提示重新选择市场</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高争议品类且用户可自选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>默认选择「站点默认辖区」，因为站点本身就是最强信号（用户主动访问了某个站点）。「最严并集」看起来更安全，却把不确定性全部转嫁成误杀，而误杀在跨境场景下会成规模出现——判据是<strong>兜底的误杀量是否可控</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"辖区覆盖率矩阵与空白格\">辖区覆盖率矩阵与空白格</h2><p>「作用域过窄」是本篇唯一无法靠事后告警发现的失败模式，因此需要一张发布前必须填满的矩阵：行是辖区，列是渠道，每个格子要么有适用规则，要么有显式的「本格无需过滤」声明。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>辖区</th>\n<th>web</th>\n<th>app</th>\n<th>ads</th>\n<th>openapi</th>\n<th>feed</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>EU</code></td>\n<td>R-EU-BASE-0001</td>\n<td>R-EU-BASE-0001</td>\n<td>R-EU-ADS-0007</td>\n<td>R-EU-BASE-0001</td>\n<td>R-EU-BASE-0001</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DE</code></td>\n<td>NARROW→DE-0088</td>\n<td>NARROW→DE-0088</td>\n<td>无需过滤声明</td>\n<td>NARROW→DE-0088</td>\n<td>无需过滤声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ID</code></td>\n<td>R-ID-0142</td>\n<td>R-ID-0142</td>\n<td>无需过滤声明</td>\n<td>R-ID-0142</td>\n<td>R-ID-0142</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SA</code></td>\n<td>R-SA-0031</td>\n<td>R-SA-0031</td>\n<td>R-SA-0031</td>\n<td><strong>空白</strong></td>\n<td>R-SA-0031</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BR</code></td>\n<td>R-BR-0012</td>\n<td>R-BR-0012</td>\n<td>无需过滤声明</td>\n<td>R-BR-0012</td>\n<td>无需过滤声明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>SA × openapi</code> 的空白格就是这张表的全部价值：它要么是缺失的规则，要么是缺失的声明，总之是一个必须被人回答的问题。做成 CI 门比看板有效——看板会被忽略，CI 会拦住发布。检查还必须同时断言<strong>不存在越过辖区的全辖区规则</strong>：一条没填 jurisdiction 的规则会让矩阵所有格子都非空，把真正的空白格掩盖掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多辖区并集执行\">多辖区并集执行</h2><p>一次请求同时受多个辖区约束时，常见做法是「取最严」，但「最严」在可执行层面需要定义。动作是有序的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>action</mtext><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mtext>hit</mtext></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>rank</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>action</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>其中 rank</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">suppress</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">downrank_strong</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">downrank_mild</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">annotate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">pass</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{action}^*(q) = \\max_{\\text{hit}} \\; \\text{rank}\\big(\\text{action}(r)\\big) \\quad \\text{其中 } \\text{rank}(\\texttt{suppress})=4 &gt; \\texttt{downrank\\_strong}=3 &gt; \\texttt{downrank\\_mild}=2 &gt; \\texttt{annotate}=1 &gt; \\texttt{pass}=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">action</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7465em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1208em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6021em;vertical-align:-0.7521em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hit</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">action</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">suppress</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">downrank_strong</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7063em;vertical-align:-0.0951em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">downrank_mild</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5536em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">annotate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6528em;vertical-align:-0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">pass</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>max 规则有一个隐含前提：<strong>动作之间全序，且强动作不破坏弱动作想达成的目的</strong>。这在降权与标注之间成立，但有两类例外。一是 <code>suppress</code> 与 <code>replace_with_notice</code> 这类<strong>互斥动作</strong>：某辖区要求展示更正而另一辖区要求下架，二者不是强弱关系，只能引入<strong>互斥组</strong>由人工发布前裁决。二是<strong>作用域维度不完全重叠的动作</strong>：辖区 A 要求对该市场降权、辖区 B 要求对该市场的未成年受众完全隐藏时，正确结果是未成年取 <code>suppress</code>、成人取 <code>downrank</code>——max 必须在<strong>每个作用域分区内</strong>分别计算。因此聚合粒度是「目标 × 作用域键」而非「目标」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分片映射的结构与缓存\">分片映射的结构与缓存</h3><p>分片映射必须可序列化、可比对、可被闸门直接查表：分片键是作用域键，值是 <code>(action, rule_id, legal_basis)</code> 三元组。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;target_id&quot;: 77120934,&#10;  &quot;snapshot_id&quot;: 90412,&#10;  &quot;shards&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;ID:id-ID:web:adult&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;suppress&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;ID-RESTRICTED-CATEGORY-0142&quot;,&#10;      &quot;legal_basis&quot;: &quot;ID-MOC-2020-No.5&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;DE:de-DE:ads:adult&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;replace_with_notice&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;DE-AD-LAW-CORRECTION-0088&quot;,&#10;      &quot;legal_basis&quot;: &quot;DE-UWG-amendment&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;unlisted_scope&quot;: { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;pass&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"target_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">77120934</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"snapshot_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90412</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shards\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ID:id-ID:web:adult\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suppress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID-RESTRICTED-CATEGORY-0142\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"legal_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID-MOC-2020-No.5\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"DE:de-DE:ads:adult\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"replace_with_notice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE-AD-LAW-CORRECTION-0088\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"legal_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE-UWG-amendment\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"unlisted_scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>unlisted_scope</code> 把「未列出即放行」写成<strong>显式字段</strong>而不是隐含语义，可审计性因此来自结构本身；它与「默认最小作用域」并不矛盾——后者约束的是规则（未写辖区的不生效），前者描述的是结果（未被任何规则命中的作用域自然放行）。</p>\n<p>映射变化频率远低于请求频率，适合缓存，但失效必须按<strong>分片</strong>而非整条记录，按目标整体失效会让一次德国规则调整清空全球缓存。TTL 上界也必须存在：失效事件本身可能丢失（下架指令因通道故障没到达），TTL 是唯一不依赖事件送达的兜底。另一个时序问题是<strong>规则撤回</strong>：监管要求被行政复议推翻时需支持「回滚到某个历史版本」而不是「新增相反规则」，机制见 <a href=\"policy-version-distribution\">策略版本化与下发</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"作用域识别的失败模式\">作用域识别的失败模式</h2><p>作用域算错的典型形态后果差别很大，值得在告警上分开对待：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>检测手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>market 识别缺失</td>\n<td>请求头缺地理/站点信息，回落默认值</td>\n<td>用错误辖区过滤，可能双向出错</td>\n<td>默认值命中率指标 + 阈值告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作用域过宽</td>\n<td>新规则未填 jurisdiction，误配为全局</td>\n<td>全球范围误杀，影响面大</td>\n<td>发布前静态检查 + 灰度流量对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作用域过窄</td>\n<td>market 列表漏写某个市场变体</td>\n<td>该市场漏放违规内容</td>\n<td>辖区覆盖率检查 + 抽样复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间窗错位</td>\n<td>生效时间用错时区，提前或延后生效</td>\n<td>短期内多拦或少拦</td>\n<td>生效时刻双人核对 + 生效后抽样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性漂移</td>\n<td>账号年龄档未更新，minor 判成 adult</td>\n<td>未成年人保护条款失效</td>\n<td>受众标签分布监控 + 周期对账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>作用域过宽</strong>与<strong>作用域过窄</strong>的处置优先级必须分开：前者可以在分钟级通过回滚止血，后者只能靠事后审计发现，因此对后者必须依赖<strong>前置的覆盖率检查</strong>而不是事后告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合规作用域是 <code>jurisdiction × market × channel × audience × time</code> 的五维谓词，必须是策略的显式属性而不是从基础设施位置推导；默认态是最小作用域。</li>\n<li>辖区规则带 <code>legal_basis</code> 锚点，这是下架决定、申诉答复与监管报送能自证的前提；谓词限定在声明式子集，判据是「可翻译成过滤表达式」且「可翻译成人类可读解释」。</li>\n<li>继承用 <code>parent_rule_id</code> + <code>override_kind</code> 显式表达，<code>NARROW</code> 只允许往更严方向改，<code>REPLACE</code> 必须引用不同文书，二者由编译器断言。</li>\n<li>地区判定按站点 → 收货地 → 账号 → 显式参数 → IP → 语言时区的优先级短路，低置信向上传递；兜底默认回落到站点默认辖区。</li>\n<li>辖区覆盖率矩阵的每个格子都必须有规则或显式声明，检查放在 CI 门里，并断言不存在越过辖区的全局规则。</li>\n<li>多辖区并集按动作强度取最大值，但法定更正与下架属于互斥组，必须人工裁决并留痕。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步是把辖区规则落到具体可判定的对象上——哪些词、哪些品类、哪些多模态特征构成违规，见 <a href=\"banned-term-taxonomy\">违禁词与受限品类分类法</a>；这些规则如何被版本化并可靠下发到每个 serving 节点，见 <a href=\"policy-version-distribution\">策略版本化与下发</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"司法辖区规则与作用域","id":"司法辖区规则与作用域"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：合规作用域是一个四元组","id":"核心概念-合规作用域是一个四元组"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能用「服务器位置」代替 jurisdiction","id":"为什么不能用-服务器位置-代替-jurisdiction"},{"level":3,"text":"作用域爆炸与它的治理","id":"作用域爆炸与它的治理"},{"level":2,"text":"辖区规则的建模：从法条到可执行对象","id":"辖区规则的建模-从法条到可执行对象"},{"level":3,"text":"谓词边界与继承语义","id":"谓词边界与继承语义"},{"level":2,"text":"辖区规则的存储与继承","id":"辖区规则的存储与继承"},{"level":2,"text":"地区判定：信号优先级与兜底","id":"地区判定-信号优先级与兜底"},{"level":2,"text":"辖区覆盖率矩阵与空白格","id":"辖区覆盖率矩阵与空白格"},{"level":2,"text":"多辖区并集执行","id":"多辖区并集执行"},{"level":3,"text":"分片映射的结构与缓存","id":"分片映射的结构与缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"作用域识别的失败模式","id":"作用域识别的失败模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"违禁词与受限品类分类法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/compliance-policy-model/banned-term-taxonomy"}}